Description: Acer Swift multimedia touchpad integration for KDE Plasma
 Swift Touch KDE provides media-strip support for Acer Swift touchpads on Linux.
 .
 The package installs a user service that maps touchpad multimedia strip actions
 to media keys, a tray controller, and a KDE System Settings entry.
